 r←Test_POSTRefresh_Accepted url;Assert;Authed;live;res;state;suffix
⍝ Check POST /admin/refresh returns 202 with a message and a status monitor URL.
⍝ Runs behind a stand-in worker so no real refresh is triggered: the assertions are
⍝ about the response envelope, which is identical for a started and a queued refresh.
 r←0
 Assert←##.Assert
 Authed←##.MAIN.Authed
 state←#.DCMS.GLOBAL.refresh
 suffix←'/admin/refresh/status'
 :Trap 0
     'Refresh already running at start of test'Assert ##.WaitRefreshIdle 150
     live←{⎕DL ⍵}&10
     state.(running thread pending)←1 live 0
     res←('POST'Authed url,'/admin/refresh').Run
     'Expected 202 Accepted'Assert 202=res.HttpStatus
     'message must be a character vector'Assert 1=≡res.Data.message
     'monitorUrl must point at the status endpoint'Assert suffix≡(-≢suffix)↑res.Data.monitorUrl
     r←1
 :EndTrap
⍝ Teardown: kill the stand-in and release the forged lock
 :If 0≠⎕NC'live'
     {}⎕TKILL live
 :EndIf
 state.(running thread pending)←0 ¯1 0
